{
  "_comment": "CANShift demo dashboard — coherent 4-page layout (overview, engine, fluids, controls). Sizes restricted to L (160×56) and XL (160×112) per issue #131; horizontal bars use H-FULL (320×28). Gauges pin `iconName` to opt into the semantic two-zone sensor palette (#954).",
